Descriptions: the table shows the first line.
--- project.yaml
modules: [a, b, c]
--- a/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
description: |
  First line
  second line
--- b/module.yaml
product: jvm/app
description: A longer description of b
--- c/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
description: ''
